# -- takes an owned playlist snapshot, feeds it through the accepted
# mixa_audio_set_list, starts playback, and opens the accepted
# MixaAudioPanel, driven by a real top-level button hit). Predefs the
# real header directly, unmodified, the same way the real mixa_audio_
# launch.lm1 already does (which itself predefs mixa_audio_panel.h.lm1,
